      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "The first step in changing PA behavior in older hospitalized patients is to explore which modifiable factors are related to PA. The aim of this study was to systematically review the literature focusing on the identification of facilitators and barriers to enhance PA in older patients ( ≥ 65 y) during hospital admission from the perspectives of patients, caregivers, and HCPs",
